nt-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/str_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:450/25\" width=\"450\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"49\">\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"399\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"128\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Hits : 216<br>Stamina : 42<br>Mana : <br>힘 : 216<br>민첩 : 42<br>지능 : 66<br>Ar : 32</span></font> </p></td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"141\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/str_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"13\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:13/13\" width=\"13\"></b></span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>전투관련</b></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">레슬링 : 69.4<br>전술 : 77.9<br>마법저항 : 27.6<br>해부학 : 36.3<br>중독술 : \n-</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/str_5.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"13\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:13/13\" width=\"13\">좋아하는 음식 \n                                    : </span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:13;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">고기(Meat)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/h.gif\" width=\"30\">ISTORY(</b>by<b>\n</b></span></font><font color=\"#3333FF\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>SIRL</b></span></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>)</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">북극에 \n            사는 이 거대한 뱀은 아이스 핀드들의 애완동물이라는 소문이 있다. \n            </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">얼음 \n            뱀이 오래 살면 거대하게 되기때문에 이들 또한 다이아몬드처럼 번쩍 \n            번쩍 빛나는 몸을 가지고 있고 얼음 뱀이 독을 쓰지 못하고 오래 산다고 \n            독 쓰는 법을 배우라는 법도 없으므로 다행히도 독을 전염 시키지 못한다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">너무 \n            추운 지역에서 살다 보니 추위에 약한 길 잃은 생명체가 알아서 얼어 \n            죽거고, </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">추위에 \n            힘을 다 못 쓰는등등 굳이 독을 안 써도 죽여서 배를 채울 수 있으니 \n            스스로 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">나태해진걸로 \n            추측된다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/l_line.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/dungeon/image/line.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/r_line.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:30/16\" width=\"30\"></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Comment \n                                        by </span></font><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>Pink</b></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;: \n                                        </span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"470\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"26\"> <p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr/dungeon/image/pink.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"65\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:40/65\" width=\"40\"></b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"424\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">브리타니아에 사는 큰뱀과 같은모습이고 색이 다르며 중독을 시키지 않는다는 \n                        것이 특징이다.</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"> <font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물리저항력과 마법저항력이 꽤 높으므로 초보자들에겐 \n약간 힘든면도 있다. <br>그랜드마스터 메이지의 경우라도 6서클의 에너지볼트로 4번이상은 공격해주어야 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">할정도이다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">보통의 큰뱀에서 \n볼수없는 아이스 봉이라는 꽤 매력적인 아이템을 줘서 한동안 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수집가들의 표적이 된 몬스터이기도 하고 지금까지도 표적이 되어있다. <br>물론 얻는 \n확율이야 매우 낮지만 준다는 것 하나만으로 이것들은 학살당할 만한 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">충분한 이유를 갖춘 \n            것이다. </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아이스던젼에서 꽤 많이 서식하고 있지만 \n이것만을 단독으로 처리하기엔 주위의 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">기타 \n            몬스터들이 너무 많다. <br>던젼의 또다른통로로 나가면 로스트랜드로 이어지는데 그곳에서는 단독으로 \n출몰하는 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:10; margin-left:15;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">경우도 있으므로 1:1을 원한다면 이것으로 가는것이 좋을 것이다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:20%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
